	(text "DRAFT / NOT INTEGRATED / NOT FOR ORDER / NO FIRE\nTFT branch ONLY: power U303 from TFT_3V3, NOT MCU_3V3.\nNexperia 74LVC125APW,118 ONLY; do not substitute generic 125.\nExternal supply / signal sources are outside this review sheet.\nRequired before integration: defined MCU-HiZ input levels,\nsource termination + cable SI, all power-ramp/dip cases,\nTFT-local reset + firmware reinitialization.\nRST and BL must stay in TFT power domain, not in this buffer.\nNo root PCB/SCH/BOM/firmware changes authorized by this sheet."
